; Pin the prioritized supported LTS (Node 24) for local dev. better-sqlite3
; >=12 ships prebuilt binaries for Node 22/24/26 (ABI 127/137/147) on
; win32-x64, linux-x64, and darwin, so installs never source-build. The
; machine-global Node (25.x) is non-LTS/out-of-maintenance and is not targeted.
use-node-version=24.18.0
